*~

# Secrets — never commit tokens
*TOKEN*
*token*.txt
credentials*

# Design data (proprietary EDA files never belong in the repo;
# drop them under samples/<project>/ which is covered below)
*.PcbDoc
*.SchDoc
*.eprj
*.epro
*.epcb
*.SchLib
*.PcbLib
*.PrjPcb

# User-provided design samples (never commit proprietary design data;
# only the convention doc is tracked)
samples/*
!samples/README.md
